// GameWorldInspector.rs:1-1287 — canonical bounded paused-world projection.
// JSON is only the payload of the existing jet.devtools.v1 envelope, not a wire protocol.
// Main publication: game.jet `module runtime`; runtime assembly
// `module kernel_game_world_inspector`. No new public game facade.
// #4392/#4318: canonical utf8_bytes still materializes bytes; retained UTF-8
// loans are required before claiming allocation/borrow parity. #4483: Int
// span offsets require selected-target usize bounds at the host ingress.
use core.text.runtime.kernel_unicode_string as world_text
use core.sys.runtime.kernel_env_config as world_ascii

// Rust :7-11,726-733.
